cat - concatenate and print
Executable: /bin/cat.sh
Alias: cat

USAGE
  cat [-n] [-p] [file...]
  cat <file> p   (legacy paging)

DESCRIPTION
  Prints the given files one
  after another. Without a file
  (or with '-') cat reads piped
  or redirected input, e.g.
    ls | cat -n

OPTIONS
  -n   number every line
  -p   pause after each screen

SEE ALSO
  less, head, tail
